{"id":"6d139079451cd2a7","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-so-validity.md","title":"Second-Order Validity","display":"df-so-validity — Second-Order Validity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-so-validity","aliases":["57-df-so-validity"],"display":"df-so-validity — Second-Order Validity","depends_on":["[[57-df-so-formula]]","[[57-df-so-sentence]]","[[57-df-so-semantics]]","[[57-df-so-assignment]]","[[57-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-so-validity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-so-validity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-so-validity — Second-Order Validity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"433037f9b53db530\" href=\"?note=433037f9b53db530\" title=\"57-df-so-formula\">57-df-so-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fcf8e66483555f57\" href=\"?note=fcf8e66483555f57\" title=\"57-df-so-sentence\">57-df-so-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"521852a49020f617\" href=\"?note=521852a49020f617\" title=\"57-df-so-semantics\">57-df-so-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9fd59242fb4200e\" href=\"?note=b9fd59242fb4200e\" title=\"57-df-so-assignment\">57-df-so-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Val}^2_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Val}^2_S\\)</span> (二阶有效公式集, 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6d139079451cd2a7\" href=\"?note=6d139079451cd2a7\" title=\"57-df-so-validity\">57-df-so-validity</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (签名, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> (S-结构, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A = |\\mathfrak{A}|\">\\(A = |\\mathfrak{A}|\\)</span> (论域, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}^2_S\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}^2_S\\)</span> (二阶公式, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"433037f9b53db530\" href=\"?note=433037f9b53db530\" title=\"57-df-so-formula\">57-df-so-formula</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}so\\text{-}validity} \\vdash \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Val}^2_S \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\forall \\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}_S \\;\\forall \\beta \\in \\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak{A}) \\;\\forall \\gamma \\in \\mathrm{Assgn}^2_S(\\mathfrak{A}) : \\mathfrak{A}, \\beta, \\gamma \\models \\varphi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}so\\text{-}validity} \\vdash \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Val}^2_S \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\forall \\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}_S \\;\\forall \\beta \\in \\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak{A}) \\;\\forall \\gamma \\in \\mathrm{Assgn}^2_S(\\mathfrak{A}) : \\mathfrak{A}, \\beta, \\gamma \\models \\varphi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}so\\text{-}validity} \\vdash \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Val}^2_S \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\forall \\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}_S : \\mathfrak{A} \\models^2_S \\varphi \\quad (\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}^2_S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}so\\text{-}validity} \\vdash \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Val}^2_S \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\forall \\mathfrak{A} \\in \\mathrm{Struct}_S : \\mathfrak{A} \\models^2_S \\varphi \\quad (\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}^2_S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Val}^2_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Val}^2_S\\)</span> : 签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 上所有<strong>有效二阶公式</strong>的集合</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 是有效的当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span>、每个一阶赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 和每个二阶赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak{A}, \\beta, \\gamma)\">\\((\\mathfrak{A}, \\beta, \\gamma)\\)</span> 中为真</li>\n<li>句子简化：对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}^2_S\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}^2_S\\)</span>（无自由一阶变量），可省略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span></li>\n<li>记号区分：\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Val}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Val}_S\\)</span> : 一阶有效公式</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Val}^2_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Val}^2_S\\)</span> : 二阶有效公式</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>二阶逻辑表达能力：\n<ul>\n<li>可以刻画有穷性：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists X\\,(|X| = \\omega)\">\\(\\exists X\\,(|X| = \\omega)\\)</span> 在有穷结构中为假</li>\n<li>可以刻画良序性、紧致性等概念</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>复杂度：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Val}^2_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Val}^2_S\\)</span> 不是递归可枚举的（高阶递归论结果）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-so-formula","status":"resolved","id":"433037f9b53db530","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"fcf8e66483555f57","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"521852a49020f617","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"b9fd59242fb4200e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-validity","status":"resolved","id":"6d139079451cd2a7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Val}^2_S$ (二阶有效公式集, 见 [[57-df-so-validity]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ (签名, see [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223